{"id":23020,"name":"纯粹思维的洗礼","rarity":5,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"午后阳光恰好，花叶芬芳。\\n他虽已时时注意洁净，思维难免会因滞涩而生尘。\\n\\n<i>「疗愈思想与保持健康同样重要。」</i>\\n愚人的喧嚣随疲惫一同远去，他沉入水中，任思绪漂浮，心神循序澄明。\\n\\n<i>「真理会躲开不洁，唯有纯粹方可接近。」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23020,"name":"思想训练","desc":"使装备者的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。敌方目标每承受1个负面效果，装备者对其造成的暴击伤害额外提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，最多叠加<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>层。施放终结技攻击敌方目标时，使装备者获得【论辩】效果，造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，追加攻击无视目标<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak></color>的防御力，该效果持续<unbreak>#6[i]</unbreak>回合。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.2,0.08,3,0.36,0.24,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.23,0.09,3,0.42,0.28,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.26,0.1,3,0.48,0.32,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.29,0.11,3,0.54,0.36,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.32,0.12,3,0.6,0.4,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":111011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110121,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110122,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110122,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":111012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110123